<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Advanced Micro raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Advanced Micro raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Tuesday it upgraded Advanced Micro Devices Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Cited company's announcement Monday it had won a contract to supply microprocessors to International Business Machines Corp.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-3/4 to 40-3/4.  On Monday AMD shares jumped five to 42-1/2.</p>
</text>
